# Guardrails First

Before any on-chain write:
1. Read `guardrails/web3-guardrails.yaml`
2. Run `/audit` for unknown contracts
3. Run `/screen` for recipient addresses
4. Run `/simulate` before submit

Block on CRITICAL risk. Warn on unlimited approvals.
